# HireMatch AI

- Follow phased delivery in `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_BACKLOG.md` and `docs/PROGRESS.md`.
- Do not implement Phase N+1 features until Phase N is reviewed.
- Never fake AI results, payment success, or email delivery without a configured provider.
- Never commit secrets; use `.env.example` only.
- Enforce tenant isolation and authorization in the backend.
- Prefer Docker Compose for local runs so any clone works the same.
- After substantive changes, update `docs/PROGRESS.md` and commit/push when the user requests remote sync.
